(945,1709,$mw$8774579CBCCD6673E022A7496671DDA8F7DA41B072765A3C5A09D1CE2C394661$mw$,$mw$680cce854883b5b3c49b8f46d7b4eb28$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1709,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":85,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"رُمِي حجر نرد عادل وعُلم أن الناتج زوجي. ما احتمال أن يكون أكبر من 3؟","TitleEn":"A fair die is rolled and the outcome is known to be even. What is the chance it exceeds 3?","QuestionTextAr":"رُمِي حجر نرد عادل وعُلم أن الناتج زوجي. ما احتمال أن يكون أكبر من 3؟","QuestionTextEn":"A fair die is rolled and the outcome is known to be even. What is the chance it exceeds 3?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: الاحتمال المشروط = عدد النواتج المناسبة ضمن فضاء الشرط ÷ عدد نواتج فضاء الشرط.\n\nخطوات الحل: الأعداد الزوجية الممكنة: 2 و4 و6 (ثلاثة نواتج). الأكبر من 3 بينها: 4 و6 (نتيجتان). إذن الاحتمال = 2÷3.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Conditional probability counts favorable outcomes within the restricted sample space.\n\nSolution steps: Given even, the possible faces are {2,4,6}. Two exceed 3: {4,6}. Therefore the probability is 2/3.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6825,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{3}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6826,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac{2}{3}","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6827,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{2}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6828,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{5}{6}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"النتيجة معلومة بأنها زوجية؛ غيّر فضاء العينة.","En":"The outcome is known to be even; restrict the sample space."},{"Ar":"عد الأوجه الزوجية التي تزيد على 3 وقارنها بكل الأوجه الزوجية.","En":"Count even faces exceeding 3 and compare with all even faces."}],"Title":{"Ar":"رُمِي حجر نرد عادل وعُلم أن الناتج زوجي. ما احتمال أن يكون أكبر من 3؟","En":"A fair die is rolled and the outcome is known to be even. What is the chance it exceeds 3?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"1/3 احتمال الوجه الزوجي الذي لا يزيد على 3.","En":"1/3 is the probability of an even face not exceeding 3."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{3}"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac{2}{3}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"1/2 يوافق احتمال تجاوز 3 قبل معرفة الشرط.","En":"1/2 is the probability of exceeding 3 before conditioning."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"5/6 ليس نسبة ممكنة لحدث من ثلاثة أوجه متساوية الاحتمال.","En":"5/6 cannot be a count ratio among three equally likely faces."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{5}{6}"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"رُمِي حجر نرد عادل وعُلم أن الناتج زوجي. ما احتمال أن يكون أكبر من 3؟","En":"A fair die is rolled and the outcome is known to be even. What is the chance it exceeds 3?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الاحتمال الشرطي يقيد فضاء العينة بالحدث المعلوم.","En":"Conditional probability restricts the sample space to the given event."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نقيد فضاء العينة بالأوجه الزوجية الثلاثة المتساوية الاحتمال.","En":"Restrict the sample space to the three equally likely even faces."},{"Ar":"$B=\\{2,4,6\\},\\quad A\\cap B=\\{4,6\\}$","En":"$B=\\{2,4,6\\},\\quad A\\cap B=\\{4,6\\}$"},{"Ar":"نقسم عدد النتائج المطلوبة على عدد النتائج الممكنة بعد الشرط.","En":"Divide favorable outcomes by possible outcomes after conditioning."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{2}{3}$","En":"$\\frac{2}{3}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم الأوجه الستة مقاماً بعد الشرط.","En":"Do not use all six faces as denominator after conditioning."},"FormulaLatex":"P(A\\mid B)=\\frac{|A\\cap B|}{|B|}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\Omega_B=\\{2,4,6\\},\\quad A\\cap B=\\{4,6\\},\\quad P=2/3$","En":"$\\Omega_B=\\{2,4,6\\},\\quad A\\cap B=\\{4,6\\},\\quad P=2/3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$P(A\\mid B)+P(A^c\\mid B)=2/3+1/3=1$","En":"$P(A\\mid B)+P(A^c\\mid B)=2/3+1/3=1$"}},"TrackIds":[9],"CategoryId":85,"PrimarySkillId":337,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"النتيجة معلومة بأنها زوجية؛ غيّر فضاء العينة.","En":"The outcome is known to be even; restrict the sample space."},{"Ar":"عد الأوجه الزوجية التي تزيد على 3 وقارنها بكل الأوجه الزوجية.","En":"Count even faces exceeding 3 and compare with all even faces."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الاحتمال الشرطي يقيد فضاء العينة بالحدث المعلوم.","En":"Conditional probability restricts the sample space to the given event."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نقيد فضاء العينة بالأوجه الزوجية الثلاثة المتساوية الاحتمال.","En":"Restrict the sample space to the three equally likely even faces."},{"Ar":"$B=\\{2,4,6\\},\\quad A\\cap B=\\{4,6\\}$","En":"$B=\\{2,4,6\\},\\quad A\\cap B=\\{4,6\\}$"},{"Ar":"نقسم عدد النتائج المطلوبة على عدد النتائج الممكنة بعد الشرط.","En":"Divide favorable outcomes by possible outcomes after conditioning."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{2}{3}$","En":"$\\frac{2}{3}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم الأوجه الستة مقاماً بعد الشرط.","En":"Do not use all six faces as denominator after conditioning."},"FormulaLatex":"P(A\\mid B)=\\frac{|A\\cap B|}{|B|}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\Omega_B=\\{2,4,6\\},\\quad A\\cap B=\\{4,6\\},\\quad P=2/3$","En":"$\\Omega_B=\\{2,4,6\\},\\quad A\\cap B=\\{4,6\\},\\quad P=2/3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$P(A\\mid B)+P(A^c\\mid B)=2/3+1/3=1$","En":"$P(A\\mid B)+P(A^c\\mid B)=2/3+1/3=1$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1/3 احتمال الوجه الزوجي الذي لا يزيد على 3.","En":"1/3 is the probability of an even face not exceeding 3."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1/2 يوافق احتمال تجاوز 3 قبل معرفة الشرط.","En":"1/2 is the probability of exceeding 3 before conditioning."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5/6 ليس نسبة ممكنة لحدث من ثلاثة أوجه متساوية الاحتمال.","En":"5/6 cannot be a count ratio among three equally likely faces."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الاحتمال الشرطي يقيد فضاء العينة بالحدث المعلوم.

$P(A\mid B)=\frac{|A\cap B|}{|B|}$

1. نقيد فضاء العينة بالأوجه الزوجية الثلاثة المتساوية الاحتمال.

2. $B=\{2,4,6\},\quad A\cap B=\{4,6\}$

3. نقسم عدد النتائج المطلوبة على عدد النتائج الممكنة بعد الشرط.

$\Omega_B=\{2,4,6\},\quad A\cap B=\{4,6\},\quad P=2/3$

$\frac{2}{3}$ بلا وحدة قياس

$P(A\mid B)+P(A^c\mid B)=2/3+1/3=1$

لا تستخدم الأوجه الستة مقاماً بعد الشرط.$mw$,$mw$Conditional probability restricts the sample space to the given event.

$P(A\mid B)=\frac{|A\cap B|}{|B|}$

1. Restrict the sample space to the three equally likely even faces.

2. $B=\{2,4,6\},\quad A\cap B=\{4,6\}$

3. Divide favorable outcomes by possible outcomes after conditioning.

$\Omega_B=\{2,4,6\},\quad A\cap B=\{4,6\},\quad P=2/3$

$\frac{2}{3}$ Dimensionless

$P(A\mid B)+P(A^c\mid B)=2/3+1/3=1$

Do not use all six faces as denominator after conditioning.$mw$),
(946,1710,$mw$058C4B6436B4F69F386407095C91029BA83626A1D8C473E7259D54480436AFD7$mw$,$mw$95345ed7b4bab01ff8d1254803fd1235$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1710,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":85,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"نرمي حجرَي نرد مختلفَي اللون. كم نتيجة مرتّبة يظهر فيها العدد 6 على حجر واحد بالضبط؟","TitleEn":"Two distinguishable dice are rolled. How many ordered outcomes have a six on exactly one die?","QuestionTextAr":"نرمي حجرَي نرد مختلفَي اللون. كم نتيجة مرتّبة يظهر فيها العدد 6 على حجر واحد بالضبط؟","QuestionTextEn":"Two distinguishable dice are rolled. How many ordered outcomes have a six on exactly one die?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مبدأ العد؛ نعد الحالات المتنافية ونجمعها.\n\nخطوات الحل: إذا كان الأول 6 فللثاني خمس قيم ليست 6. وإذا كان الثاني 6 فللأول خمس قيم. المجموع 5+5=10، ولا نحسب (6،6).","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Count mutually exclusive cases and add their outcomes.\n\nSolution steps: If the first die is 6, the second has five non-six possibilities. Reversing the roles gives five more. Total 5+5=10; (6,6) is excluded.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6829,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6830,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6831,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6832,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"يجب ظهور ستة على نرد واحد فقط.","En":"A six must appear on exactly one die."},{"Ar":"عد الخيارات الأخرى للنرد الثاني في كل حالة، ثم اجمع الحالتين.","En":"Count non-six choices for the other die in each case, then add the cases."}],"Title":{"Ar":"نرمي حجرَي نرد مختلفَي اللون. كم نتيجة مرتّبة يظهر فيها العدد 6 على حجر واحد بالضبط؟","En":"Two distinguishable dice are rolled. How many ordered outcomes have a six on exactly one die?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"5 يحسب حالة واحدة فقط.","En":"5 counts only one case."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"10"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"11 يشمل النتيجة (6,6) المخالفة للشرط.","En":"11 includes (6,6), which violates the condition."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"11"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"12 يعد ستة خيارات في كل حالة ويشمل الوجه الممنوع.","En":"12 counts six choices in each case, including the forbidden face."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"12"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"نرمي حجرَي نرد مختلفَي اللون. كم نتيجة مرتّبة يظهر فيها العدد 6 على حجر واحد بالضبط؟","En":"Two distinguishable dice are rolled. How many ordered outcomes have a six on exactly one die?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعد حالتين متنافيتين: الستة في النرد الأول وحده أو في الثاني وحده.","En":"Count two disjoint cases: six on the first die only, or on the second only."},"Unit":{"Ar":"","En":""},"Steps":[{"Ar":"إذا ظهر 6 على النرد الأول، فللثاني خمسة أوجه غير 6.","En":"If the first die shows 6, the second has five non-six faces."},{"Ar":"إذا ظهر 6 على النرد الثاني، فللأول خمسة أوجه غير 6.","En":"If the second die shows 6, the first has five non-six faces."},{"Ar":"الحالتان متنافيتان والنتائج مرتبة، لذا نجمع عدديهما.","En":"The cases are disjoint and outcomes ordered, so add their counts."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"استبعد (6,6) ولا تعد الحالات المشتركة مرتين.","En":"Exclude (6,6) and do not double-count."},"FormulaLatex":"N=2(6-1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5+5=10$","En":"$5+5=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6\\times6-5\\times5-1=10$","En":"$6\\times6-5\\times5-1=10$"}},"TrackIds":[9],"CategoryId":85,"PrimarySkillId":336,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"يجب ظهور ستة على نرد واحد فقط.","En":"A six must appear on exactly one die."},{"Ar":"عد الخيارات الأخرى للنرد الثاني في كل حالة، ثم اجمع الحالتين.","En":"Count non-six choices for the other die in each case, then add the cases."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعد حالتين متنافيتين: الستة في النرد الأول وحده أو في الثاني وحده.","En":"Count two disjoint cases: six on the first die only, or on the second only."},"Unit":{"Ar":"","En":""},"Steps":[{"Ar":"إذا ظهر 6 على النرد الأول، فللثاني خمسة أوجه غير 6.","En":"If the first die shows 6, the second has five non-six faces."},{"Ar":"إذا ظهر 6 على النرد الثاني، فللأول خمسة أوجه غير 6.","En":"If the second die shows 6, the first has five non-six faces."},{"Ar":"الحالتان متنافيتان والنتائج مرتبة، لذا نجمع عدديهما.","En":"The cases are disjoint and outcomes ordered, so add their counts."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"استبعد (6,6) ولا تعد الحالات المشتركة مرتين.","En":"Exclude (6,6) and do not double-count."},"FormulaLatex":"N=2(6-1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$5+5=10$","En":"$5+5=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6\\times6-5\\times5-1=10$","En":"$6\\times6-5\\times5-1=10$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5 يحسب حالة واحدة فقط.","En":"5 counts only one case."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"11 يشمل النتيجة (6,6) المخالفة للشرط.","En":"11 includes (6,6), which violates the condition."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"12 يعد ستة خيارات في كل حالة ويشمل الوجه الممنوع.","En":"12 counts six choices in each case, including the forbidden face."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نعد حالتين متنافيتين: الستة في النرد الأول وحده أو في الثاني وحده.

$N=2(6-1)$

1. إذا ظهر 6 على النرد الأول، فللثاني خمسة أوجه غير 6.

2. إذا ظهر 6 على النرد الثاني، فللأول خمسة أوجه غير 6.

3. الحالتان متنافيتان والنتائج مرتبة، لذا نجمع عدديهما.

$5+5=10$

$10$

$6\times6-5\times5-1=10$

استبعد (6,6) ولا تعد الحالات المشتركة مرتين.$mw$,$mw$Count two disjoint cases: six on the first die only, or on the second only.

$N=2(6-1)$

1. If the first die shows 6, the second has five non-six faces.

2. If the second die shows 6, the first has five non-six faces.

3. The cases are disjoint and outcomes ordered, so add their counts.

$5+5=10$

$10$

$6\times6-5\times5-1=10$

Exclude (6,6) and do not double-count.$mw$),
(947,1711,$mw$85EF447D065155CA64084B3B180735AF6146B24C1DB47A7D913060751CB0D270$mw$,$mw$06991b70e3d4352fd5533e1fe4c5753c$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1711,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":87,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"متجه مستوٍ مركبتاه (a,4)، وطوله 5، مع العلم أن a سالب. ما قيمة a؟","TitleEn":"A plane vector is (a,4), its length is 5, and a is negative. Find a.","QuestionTextAr":"متجه مستوٍ مركبتاه (a,4)، وطوله 5، مع العلم أن a سالب. ما قيمة a؟","QuestionTextEn":"A plane vector is (a,4), its length is 5, and a is negative. Find a.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: طول المتجه = الجذر التربيعي لمجموع مربعي المركبتين.\n\nخطوات الحل: من العلاقة a²+4²=5² نحصل على a²=25−16=9. القيمتان ±3، وبما أن a سالب فالإجابة −3.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Euclidean norm satisfies |(a,b)|²=a²+b².\n\nSolution steps: Use a²+4²=5², so a²=25−16=9. The possible values are ±3; the negative condition selects −3.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6833,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6834,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"-4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6835,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"-3","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6836,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"اكتب معادلة مربع طول المتجه.","En":"Write the equation for the squared vector length."},{"Ar":"اعزل مربع المركبة واختر الجذر الموافق للشرط.","En":"Isolate the squared component and choose the root matching the condition."}],"Title":{"Ar":"متجه مستوٍ مركبتاه (a,4)، وطوله 5، مع العلم أن a سالب. ما قيمة a؟","En":"A plane vector is (a,4), its length is 5, and a is negative. Find a."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"−5 يعطي مربع طول 41 لا 25.","En":"−5 gives squared length 41, not 25."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-5"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"−4 يعطي مربع طول 32 لا 25.","En":"−4 gives squared length 32, not 25."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-4"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"-3"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"3 يحقق الطول لكنه يخالف شرط الإشارة.","En":"3 satisfies the length but violates the sign condition."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"3"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"متجه مستوٍ مركبتاه (a,4)، وطوله 5، مع العلم أن a سالب. ما قيمة a؟","En":"A plane vector is (a,4), its length is 5, and a is negative. Find a."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"طول المتجه يحدد مربع المركبة المجهولة، والشرط يحدد إشارتها.","En":"Vector length determines the unknown component squared, while the sign condition selects the root."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"$\\sqrt{a^2+4^2}=5$","En":"$\\sqrt{a^2+4^2}=5$"},{"Ar":"$a^2=25-16=9$","En":"$a^2=25-16=9$"},{"Ar":"الجذران هما 3 و−3؛ الشرط أن المركبة سالبة يحدد الجذر السالب.","En":"The roots are 3 and −3; the negative-component condition selects the negative root."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-3$","En":"$-3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تختَر الجذر الموجب عندما يشترط السؤال السالب.","En":"Do not choose the positive root when the problem specifies negative."},"FormulaLatex":"a^2+b^2=r^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$a^2+16=25\\Rightarrow a^2=9\\Rightarrow a=-3$","En":"$a^2+16=25\\Rightarrow a^2=9\\Rightarrow a=-3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\sqrt{(-3)^2+4^2}=5$","En":"$\\sqrt{(-3)^2+4^2}=5$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":87,"PrimarySkillId":339,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"اكتب معادلة مربع طول المتجه.","En":"Write the equation for the squared vector length."},{"Ar":"اعزل مربع المركبة واختر الجذر الموافق للشرط.","En":"Isolate the squared component and choose the root matching the condition."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"طول المتجه يحدد مربع المركبة المجهولة، والشرط يحدد إشارتها.","En":"Vector length determines the unknown component squared, while the sign condition selects the root."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"$\\sqrt{a^2+4^2}=5$","En":"$\\sqrt{a^2+4^2}=5$"},{"Ar":"$a^2=25-16=9$","En":"$a^2=25-16=9$"},{"Ar":"الجذران هما 3 و−3؛ الشرط أن المركبة سالبة يحدد الجذر السالب.","En":"The roots are 3 and −3; the negative-component condition selects the negative root."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-3$","En":"$-3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تختَر الجذر الموجب عندما يشترط السؤال السالب.","En":"Do not choose the positive root when the problem specifies negative."},"FormulaLatex":"a^2+b^2=r^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$a^2+16=25\\Rightarrow a^2=9\\Rightarrow a=-3$","En":"$a^2+16=25\\Rightarrow a^2=9\\Rightarrow a=-3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\sqrt{(-3)^2+4^2}=5$","En":"$\\sqrt{(-3)^2+4^2}=5$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−5 يعطي مربع طول 41 لا 25.","En":"−5 gives squared length 41, not 25."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−4 يعطي مربع طول 32 لا 25.","En":"−4 gives squared length 32, not 25."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"3 يحقق الطول لكنه يخالف شرط الإشارة.","En":"3 satisfies the length but violates the sign condition."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$طول المتجه يحدد مربع المركبة المجهولة، والشرط يحدد إشارتها.

$a^2+b^2=r^2$

1. $\sqrt{a^2+4^2}=5$

2. $a^2=25-16=9$

3. الجذران هما 3 و−3؛ الشرط أن المركبة سالبة يحدد الجذر السالب.

$a^2+16=25\Rightarrow a^2=9\Rightarrow a=-3$

$-3$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\sqrt{(-3)^2+4^2}=5$

لا تختَر الجذر الموجب عندما يشترط السؤال السالب.$mw$,$mw$Vector length determines the unknown component squared, while the sign condition selects the root.

$a^2+b^2=r^2$

1. $\sqrt{a^2+4^2}=5$

2. $a^2=25-16=9$

3. The roots are 3 and −3; the negative-component condition selects the negative root.

$a^2+16=25\Rightarrow a^2=9\Rightarrow a=-3$

$-3$ Dimensionless

$\sqrt{(-3)^2+4^2}=5$

Do not choose the positive root when the problem specifies negative.$mw$),
(948,1712,$mw$FDDBA786777D856AE8C278E6EF4C9F1442688B7601FEEE7412E507431B79E1AC$mw$,$mw$2d5ef1fcc622cb7b1baf3c810c75ac63$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1712,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":87,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"إذا كان u=(1,2) وv=(3,0) وw=(−1,1)، فما قيمة u·(v+w)؟","TitleEn":"If u=(1,2), v=(3,0), and w=(−1,1), compute u·(v+w).","QuestionTextAr":"إذا كان u=(1,2) وv=(3,0) وw=(−1,1)، فما قيمة u·(v+w)؟","QuestionTextEn":"If u=(1,2), v=(3,0), and w=(−1,1), compute u·(v+w).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: خاصية التوزيع للضرب القياسي u·(v+w)=u·v+u·w.\n\nخطوات الحل: أولاً v+w=(2,1). ثم u·(2,1)=1×2+2×1=4. ويمكن التحقق أيضاً بجمع u·v=3 وu·w=1.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: The dot product distributes over vector addition: u·(v+w)=u·v+u·w.\n\nSolution steps: First v+w=(2,1), then u·(2,1)=1×2+2×1=4. Equivalently u·v=3 and u·w=1, giving 4.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6837,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6838,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6839,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6840,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بجمع المتجهين داخل القوس.","En":"Start by adding the vectors inside parentheses."},{"Ar":"احسب الضرب القياسي بين u والمتجه الناتج.","En":"Take the dot product of u and the resulting vector."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إذا كان u=(1,2) وv=(3,0) وw=(−1,1)، فما قيمة u·(v+w)؟","En":"If u=(1,2), v=(3,0), and w=(−1,1), compute u·(v+w)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"−1 لا يوافق أي مجموع صحيح للجداءين 2 و2.","En":"−1 is not the sum of the two products 2 and 2."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-1"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"2 يمثل جداء مركبة واحدة فقط.","En":"2 accounts for only one component product."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"2"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"6 لا يوافق جمع الجداءين 2 و2.","En":"6 is not the sum of products 2 and 2."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا كان u=(1,2) وv=(3,0) وw=(−1,1)، فما قيمة u·(v+w)؟","En":"If u=(1,2), v=(3,0), and w=(−1,1), compute u·(v+w)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب القياسي توزيعي بالنسبة لجمع المتجهات.","En":"The dot product distributes over vector addition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"$v+w=(3-1,0+1)=(2,1)$","En":"$v+w=(3-1,0+1)=(2,1)$"},{"Ar":"نضرب المركبات المتناظرة ثم نجمع الجداءين.","En":"Multiply corresponding components, then add their products."},{"Ar":"$u\\cdot(v+w)=1(2)+2(1)=4$","En":"$u\\cdot(v+w)=1(2)+2(1)=4$"}],"Result":{"Ar":"$4$","En":"$4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين الجمع والضرب القياسي.","En":"Do not confuse vector addition with dot product."},"FormulaLatex":"\\mathbf u\\cdot(\\mathbf v+\\mathbf w)=\\mathbf u\\cdot\\mathbf v+\\mathbf u\\cdot\\mathbf w","Substitution":{"Ar":"$v+w=(2,1),\\quad (1,2)\\cdot(2,1)=2+2=4$","En":"$v+w=(2,1),\\quad (1,2)\\cdot(2,1)=2+2=4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(1,2)\\cdot(3,0)+(1,2)\\cdot(-1,1)=3+1=4$","En":"$(1,2)\\cdot(3,0)+(1,2)\\cdot(-1,1)=3+1=4$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":87,"PrimarySkillId":338,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بجمع المتجهين داخل القوس.","En":"Start by adding the vectors inside parentheses."},{"Ar":"احسب الضرب القياسي بين u والمتجه الناتج.","En":"Take the dot product of u and the resulting vector."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الضرب القياسي توزيعي بالنسبة لجمع المتجهات.","En":"The dot product distributes over vector addition."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"$v+w=(3-1,0+1)=(2,1)$","En":"$v+w=(3-1,0+1)=(2,1)$"},{"Ar":"نضرب المركبات المتناظرة ثم نجمع الجداءين.","En":"Multiply corresponding components, then add their products."},{"Ar":"$u\\cdot(v+w)=1(2)+2(1)=4$","En":"$u\\cdot(v+w)=1(2)+2(1)=4$"}],"Result":{"Ar":"$4$","En":"$4$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط بين الجمع والضرب القياسي.","En":"Do not confuse vector addition with dot product."},"FormulaLatex":"\\mathbf u\\cdot(\\mathbf v+\\mathbf w)=\\mathbf u\\cdot\\mathbf v+\\mathbf u\\cdot\\mathbf w","Substitution":{"Ar":"$v+w=(2,1),\\quad (1,2)\\cdot(2,1)=2+2=4$","En":"$v+w=(2,1),\\quad (1,2)\\cdot(2,1)=2+2=4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(1,2)\\cdot(3,0)+(1,2)\\cdot(-1,1)=3+1=4$","En":"$(1,2)\\cdot(3,0)+(1,2)\\cdot(-1,1)=3+1=4$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−1 لا يوافق أي مجموع صحيح للجداءين 2 و2.","En":"−1 is not the sum of the two products 2 and 2."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 يمثل جداء مركبة واحدة فقط.","En":"2 accounts for only one component product."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"6 لا يوافق جمع الجداءين 2 و2.","En":"6 is not the sum of products 2 and 2."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الضرب القياسي توزيعي بالنسبة لجمع المتجهات.

$\mathbf u\cdot(\mathbf v+\mathbf w)=\mathbf u\cdot\mathbf v+\mathbf u\cdot\mathbf w$

1. $v+w=(3-1,0+1)=(2,1)$

2. نضرب المركبات المتناظرة ثم نجمع الجداءين.

3. $u\cdot(v+w)=1(2)+2(1)=4$

$v+w=(2,1),\quad (1,2)\cdot(2,1)=2+2=4$

$4$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(1,2)\cdot(3,0)+(1,2)\cdot(-1,1)=3+1=4$

لا تخلط بين الجمع والضرب القياسي.$mw$,$mw$The dot product distributes over vector addition.

$\mathbf u\cdot(\mathbf v+\mathbf w)=\mathbf u\cdot\mathbf v+\mathbf u\cdot\mathbf w$

1. $v+w=(3-1,0+1)=(2,1)$

2. Multiply corresponding components, then add their products.

3. $u\cdot(v+w)=1(2)+2(1)=4$

$v+w=(2,1),\quad (1,2)\cdot(2,1)=2+2=4$

$4$ Dimensionless

$(1,2)\cdot(3,0)+(1,2)\cdot(-1,1)=3+1=4$

Do not confuse vector addition with dot product.$mw$),
(949,1713,$mw$2D30F7798242985C9F67ECDF31872D33F2F563B2174ED0671E3AE105D42F11EB$mw$,$mw$405fdbe96fe74f650a74f67543ab25ad$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":1713,"StageId":4,"CategoryId":91,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"للدالة f(x)=(x+2)²+5 مع القيد x≥0، ما أصغر قيمة ممكنة؟","TitleEn":"For f(x)=(x+2)²+5 restricted to x≥0, what is the minimum value?","QuestionTextAr":"للدالة f(x)=(x+2)²+5 مع القيد x≥0، ما أصغر قيمة ممكنة؟","QuestionTextEn":"For f(x)=(x+2)²+5 restricted to x≥0, what is the minimum value?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: نفحص النقطة الحرجة والحدود المسموحة؛ رأس القطع المكافئ x=−2 خارج المجال.\n\nخطوات الحل: بما أن x≥0، تكون (x+2)² أصغر ما يمكن عند x=0. نحسب f(0)=2²+5=9. إذن الحد الأدنى هو 9.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Constrained minimization checks stationary points and boundary values; the unconstrained vertex x=−2 is infeasible.\n\nSolution steps: On x≥0, (x+2)² is smallest at x=0. Thus f(0)=2²+5=9, the global minimum on the allowed domain.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":6841,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6842,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":6843,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":6844,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"13","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدّد موضع رأس القطع المكافئ أولاً.","En":"Find the quadratic vertex first."},{"Ar":"إذا كان الرأس خارج المجال x≥0 فافحص الحد الطرفي الأقرب إليه.","En":"If the vertex lies outside x≥0, examine the closest boundary point."}],"Title":{"Ar":"للدالة f(x)=(x+2)²+5 مع القيد x≥0، ما أصغر قيمة ممكنة؟","En":"For f(x)=(x+2)²+5 restricted to x≥0, what is the minimum value?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"5 قيمة الرأس غير المسموح.","En":"5 is the infeasible vertex value."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"7 أقل من الحد الأدنى الممكن 9.","En":"7 is below the feasible minimum 9."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"7"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"9"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"13 أكبر من القيمة عند x=0.","En":"13 exceeds the value at x=0."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"13"}],"StageId":4,"Question":{"Ar":"للدالة f(x)=(x+2)²+5 مع القيد x≥0، ما أصغر قيمة ممكنة؟","En":"For f(x)=(x+2)²+5 restricted to x≥0, what is the minimum value?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الرأس غير المقيد x=−2 خارج المجال؛ المربع يزداد عندما x≥0.","En":"The unconstrained vertex −2 is infeasible; the square increases for x≥0."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الرأس عند x=−2 خارج المجال المسموح.","En":"The vertex at x=−2 is outside the feasible domain."},{"Ar":"$x\\ge0\\Rightarrow x+2\\ge2\\Rightarrow(x+2)^2\\ge4$","En":"$x\\ge0\\Rightarrow x+2\\ge2\\Rightarrow(x+2)^2\\ge4$"},{"Ar":"المساواة تتحقق عند الحد الطرفي x=0، فنضيف الثابت 5.","En":"Equality occurs at the boundary x=0; add the constant 5."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$9$","En":"$9$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"5 حد أدنى غير مقيد ولا يتحقق في المجال المطلوب.","En":"5 is the unconstrained minimum and is not attained in the allowed domain."},"FormulaLatex":"x\\ge0\\Rightarrow (x+2)^2\\ge4","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x=0\\Rightarrow f(0)=9$","En":"$x=0\\Rightarrow f(0)=9$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f'(x)=2(x+2)>0\\quad(x\\ge0)$","En":"$f'(x)=2(x+2)>0\\quad(x\\ge0)$"}},"TrackIds":[19,21],"CategoryId":91,"PrimarySkillId":341,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدّد موضع رأس القطع المكافئ أولاً.","En":"Find the quadratic vertex first."},{"Ar":"إذا كان الرأس خارج المجال x≥0 فافحص الحد الطرفي الأقرب إليه.","En":"If the vertex lies outside x≥0, examine the closest boundary point."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الرأس غير المقيد x=−2 خارج المجال؛ المربع يزداد عندما x≥0.","En":"The unconstrained vertex −2 is infeasible; the square increases for x≥0."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة محددة","En":"No specified unit"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الرأس عند x=−2 خارج المجال المسموح.","En":"The vertex at x=−2 is outside the feasible domain."},{"Ar":"$x\\ge0\\Rightarrow x+2\\ge2\\Rightarrow(x+2)^2\\ge4$","En":"$x\\ge0\\Rightarrow x+2\\ge2\\Rightarrow(x+2)^2\\ge4$"},{"Ar":"المساواة تتحقق عند الحد الطرفي x=0، فنضيف الثابت 5.","En":"Equality occurs at the boundary x=0; add the constant 5."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$9$","En":"$9$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"5 حد أدنى غير مقيد ولا يتحقق في المجال المطلوب.","En":"5 is the unconstrained minimum and is not attained in the allowed domain."},"FormulaLatex":"x\\ge0\\Rightarrow (x+2)^2\\ge4","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x=0\\Rightarrow f(0)=9$","En":"$x=0\\Rightarrow f(0)=9$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$f'(x)=2(x+2)>0\\quad(x\\ge0)$","En":"$f'(x)=2(x+2)>0\\quad(x\\ge0)$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5 قيمة الرأس غير المسموح.","En":"5 is the infeasible vertex value."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"7 أقل من الحد الأدنى الممكن 9.","En":"7 is below the feasible minimum 9."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"13 أكبر من القيمة عند x=0.","En":"13 exceeds the value at x=0."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الرأس غير المقيد x=−2 خارج المجال؛ المربع يزداد عندما x≥0.

$x\ge0\Rightarrow (x+2)^2\ge4$

1. الرأس عند x=−2 خارج المجال المسموح.

2. $x\ge0\Rightarrow x+2\ge2\Rightarrow(x+2)^2\ge4$

3. المساواة تتحقق عند الحد الطرفي x=0، فنضيف الثابت 5.

$x=0\Rightarrow f(0)=9$

$9$ بلا وحدة محددة

$f'(x)=2(x+2)>0\quad(x\ge0)$

5 حد أدنى غير مقيد ولا يتحقق في المجال المطلوب.$mw$,$mw$The unconstrained vertex −2 is infeasible; the square increases for x≥0.

$x\ge0\Rightarrow (x+2)^2\ge4$

1. The vertex at x=−2 is outside the feasible domain.

2. $x\ge0\Rightarrow x+2\ge2\Rightarrow(x+2)^2\ge4$

3. Equality occurs at the boundary x=0; add the constant 5.

$x=0\Rightarrow f(0)=9$

$9$ No specified unit

$f'(x)=2(x+2)>0\quad(x\ge0)$

5 is the unconstrained minimum and is not attained in the allowed domain.$mw$);
DO $audit$
DECLARE b record; d "CurriculumDraftItems"%ROWTYPE; p "Problems"%ROWTYPE; tr int; sk int; n int; actor int;
BEGIN
 FOR b IN SELECT * FROM reviewed_batch ORDER BY source LOOP
  PERFORM pg_advisory_xact_lock(-b.source::bigint);
  SELECT * INTO STRICT d FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "Id"=b.draft FOR UPDATE;
  SELECT * INTO STRICT p FROM "Problems" WHERE "Id"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "QuestionOptions" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  actor:=d."OwnerUserId"; tr:=(b.wizard->'TrackIds'->>0)::int; sk:=(b.wizard->>'PrimarySkillId')::int;
  IF d."SourceProblemId" IS DISTINCT FROM b.source OR d."Revision"<>0 OR d."EditorialStatus"<>'Draft' OR d."PublishedProblemId" IS NOT NULL OR d."SourceFingerprint" IS DISTINCT FROM b.fp OR md5(d."WizardJson") IS DISTINCT FROM b.draft_hash OR upper(encode(sha256(decode(b.source_hex,'hex')),'hex'))<>b.fp OR (SELECT json_build_object('Id',pp."Id",'StageId',pp."StageId",'CategoryId',pp."CategoryId",'Points',pp."Points",'TitleAr',pp."TitleAr",'TitleEn',pp."TitleEn",'QuestionTextAr',pp."QuestionTextAr",'QuestionTextEn',pp."QuestionTextEn",'DetailedSolutionAr',pp."DetailedSolutionAr",'DetailedSolutionEn',pp."DetailedSolutionEn",'YoutubeSolutionUrl',pp."YoutubeSolutionUrl",'EditorialDetailsJson',pp."EditorialDetailsJson",'Options',(select json_agg(json_build_object('Id',o."Id",'Order',o."Order",'LatexCode',o."LatexCode",'IsCorrect',o."IsCorrect") order by o."Order",o."Id") from "QuestionOptions" o where o."ProblemId"=pp."Id"))::jsonb FROM "Problems" pp WHERE pp."Id"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM b.snapshot THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Source/draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Users" WHERE "Id"=actor AND "Role"='Admin' AND "IsActive" AND NOT "StaffSetupPending") OR (SELECT count(*) FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "SourceProblemId"=b.source AND "EditorialStatus" NOT IN ('Published','Withdrawn'))<>1 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Owner/open-draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int) ORDER BY "Id" FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id"=tr AND "StageId"=p."StageId" AND "IsPublished" AND "Revision"<2147483647) OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Categories" WHERE "Id"=p."CategoryId" AND "StageId"=p."StageId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumSkills" s JOIN "CurriculumDomains" dm ON dm."Id"=s."DomainId" WHERE s."Id"=sk AND s."StageId"=p."StageId" AND s."CategoryId"=p."CategoryId" AND s."IsPublished" AND dm."IsPublished") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "SkillId"=sk) OR (SELECT array_agg("TrackId" ORDER BY "TrackId") FROM "LearningTrackProblems" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int ORDER BY 1) OR (SELECT array_agg("SkillId" ORDER BY "SkillId") FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY[sk] OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source AND "SkillId"=sk AND "IsPrimary") OR EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds') j(id) LEFT JOIN "LearningTracks" lt ON lt."Id"=j.id::int WHERE lt."Id" IS NULL OR lt."StageId"<>p."StageId" OR lt."Revision">=2147483647 OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "SkillId"=sk)) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Scope conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Problems" q WHERE q."Id"<>b.source AND q."StageId"=p."StageId" AND (upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')) OR upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')))) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Duplicate: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" x WHERE x."Id"<>b.draft AND x."EditorialStatus" NOT IN ('Published','Withdrawn') AND (x."WizardJson"::jsonb#>>'{Question,Ar}'=p."QuestionTextAr" OR x."WizardJson"::jsonb#>>'{Question,En}'=p."QuestionTextEn")) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Open draft duplicate: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF b.wizard#>>'{Question,Ar}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextAr" OR b.wizard#>>'{Question,En}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextEn" OR length(b.flat_ar)>12000 OR length(b.flat_en)>12000 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Question/length conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  UPDATE "Problems" SET "TitleAr"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,Ar}',"TitleEn"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,En}',"DetailedSolutionAr"=b.flat_ar,"DetailedSolutionEn"=b.flat_en,"EditorialDetailsJson"=b.metadata WHERE "Id"=b.source;
  UPDATE "CurriculumDraftItems" SET "WizardJson"=b.wizard::text,"EditorialStatus"='Published',"Revision"=4,"SubmittedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedByUserId"=actor,"ReviewNote"='Owner-authorized SQL maintenance; AI educational review and source-locked verification. Existing draft owner recorded for attribution; no API login.',"PublishedAtUtc"=now(),"PublishedProblemId"=b.source WHERE "Id"=b.draft;
  UPDATE "LearningTracks" SET "Revision"="Revision"+1 WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int);
  INSERT INTO "PlatformActivityEvents"("ActorUserId","ActorRole","Action","Resource","ResourceId","Origin","CreatedAtUtc") SELECT actor,'Admin',action,'EditorialProblem',b.draft::text,'owner_sql',now() FROM unnest(ARRAY['EditorialDraftEdited','EditorialDraftSubmitted','EditorialDraftApproved','EditorialAmendmentPublished']) action;
 END LOOP;
END $audit$;
COMMIT;
